  "solution": "The Logic here is as follows:\n\n**(1st number) : {(****√****1st number + 1)² – 1}**\n\n**In **144 : 168 \n\n**(1st number) : {(****√****1st number + 1)² – 1}**\n\n= 144 : {(√144 + 1)² – 1}\n\n= 144 : {(12 + 1)² – 1}\n\n= 144 : (13² – 1)\n\n= 144 : (169 – 1)\n\n= 144 : 168\n\n**Similarly,**\n\n**In option (3) **\n\n121 : 143\n\n**(1st number) : {(****√****1st number + 1)² – 1}**\n\n= 121 : {(√121 + 1)² – 1}\n\n= 121 : {(11 + 1)² – 1}\n\n= 121 : (12² – 1)\n\n= 121 : (144 – 1)\n\n= 121 : 143\n\nHence, **“****121 : 143****”** is the correct answer.",
